<TITLE>1.4.2.9.2. Graphical Output and Interpretation</TITLE>
</HEAD>

<BODY BGCOLOR="FFFFCC">

<IMG SRC="../../gifs/nvgtbr.gif" BORDER=0 VALIGN="TOP" ISMAP USEMAP="#MenuBar">
